// 3.18.0 몸 그래프: 마우스를 올리면 가장 가까운 날짜의 값을 커서 옆에(그래프를 가리지 않게 위쪽으로)
root.addEventListener('pointermove',event=>{const svg=event.target.closest?.('.bchart');const tip=document.getElementById('bc-tip');if(!svg){if(tip)tip.hidden=true;document.querySelectorAll('.bc-guide').forEach(g=>g.setAttribute('visibility','hidden'));return}let pts;try{pts=JSON.parse(svg.dataset.pts||'[]')}catch{return}if(!pts.length)return;const r=svg.getBoundingClientRect(),vx=(event.clientX-r.left)*360/r.width,p=pts.reduce((a,b)=>Math.abs(b.x-vx)<Math.abs(a.x-vx)?b:a);const g=svg.querySelector('.bc-guide');g?.setAttribute('x1',p.x);g?.setAttribute('x2',p.x);g?.setAttribute('visibility','visible');let t=tip;if(!t){t=document.createElement('div');t.id='bc-tip';t.className='bc-tip';t.setAttribute('role','status');document.body.appendChild(t)}t.innerHTML=`<b>${p.d.slice(5).replace('-','/')}</b>${p.r.map(([n,v,u])=>`<span>${n} <strong>${v}${u}</strong></span>`).join('')}`;t.hidden=false;const w=t.offsetWidth,h=t.offsetHeight;let x=event.clientX+14,y=event.clientY-h-14;if(x+w>innerWidth-8)x=event.clientX-w-14;if(y<8)y=event.clientY+18;t.style.left=x+'px';t.style.top=y+'px'});
